            "review_title": "Review at Trung Nguyen Legend Cafe",
            "review_text": "Max\nDa Nang, Vietnam292 contributions\n0\nWonderful Special 8\nJan 2023\nI love their special 8 espresso, even though it's on the pricey side. They have pretty latte art too. However, I don't recommend their ice cream. Can't really taste the flavours. Lovely place to chill and take pictures, there's an indoor water fountain feature with carp fish in the pond.\nValue\nService\nWritten January 9, 2023",
